{"type":"text","timestamp":1788487903589,"sessionID":"ses_f95d0ae30ffeqPrKdNe1Wi4wU9","part":{"id":"prt_06a2fa7a1001hGDFHaZ7IzfxJa","messageID":"msg_06a2f6e67001v96LLShpCm0TZ9","sessionID":"ses_f95d0ae30ffeqPrKdNe1Wi4wU9","type":"text","text":"The directory is empty, so I’ll build the service from scratch. The implementation will use a locked in-memory store, transactional atomic JSON-file replacement, strict request validation, and threaded request handling with graceful signal shutdown.","time":{"start":1788487903137,"end":1788487903582},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_00fa1247c20239c8016a9a28dd8fb087d1a1f25fb874bc70e2","phase":"commentary"}}}}
